        <a href="https://ldr.lafayette.edu/collections/student-publications">Student Publications</a><br>
        <a href="https://ldr.lafayette.edu/collections/eisenhower">General Eisenhower at Lafayette: Founders' Day 1946</a><br>
        <a href="https://ldr.lafayette.edu/collections/historical-photos">College Archives Image Collection</a><br>
        <a href="https://ldr.lafayette.edu/collections/college-administration">College Administration</a><br>
        <a href="https://ldr.lafayette.edu/collections/public-safety">Public Safety</a><br>
